WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.540
What if you could challenge the AI

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.760
shaping your future and see which answers

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.360
actually stand up?

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.040
Macro-Epistemics asks how AI claims hold

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.200
up across domains.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.620
Our first instrument, Veracity, makes those
claims

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.740
open to challenge.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.440
We save an answer, then challenge a claim.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.200
The model can defend or revise.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.960
Three jurors judge the original.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.720
We grade correctness separately, using the
task's

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:35.980
evidence and reference.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.800
In our legal pilot, GLM defended an

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.080
inference with genuine quotations.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.660
Three DeepSeek jurors agreed.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.380
The benchmark reference disagreed.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.620
Even agreement needs checking.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.840
On one saved error, DeepSeek corrected itself

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.340
in one of five reviews and all

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:04.800
five source audits.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:07.420
We're looking for the conditions that help

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:08.900
models correct themselves.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:13.720
These are early results.

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.940
Repeating one case cannot establish broad
reliability.

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:20.560
Next, we measure confidence across more tasks,

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.060
and test whether these signals help people

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:24.060
make better decisions.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.160
Human knowledge grows when ideas can be

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:29.680
questioned and corrected.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:33.180
Imagine giving AI that same discipline.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.060
Claims you can inspect.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:36.900
Evidence you can trace.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:39.500
Corrections others can learn from.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:43.000
A shared foundation for decisions we make
together.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:49.680
Help us build a future where AI

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:50.860
earns our trust.
